\"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>PP \u2013 anemia:</strong></u></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11879]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Blood loss &gt;500ml during delivery.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11880]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>check</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11881]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Hb within 48 hours</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11882]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11883]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Oral iron</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> for 3m</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>parenteral</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong> Iron</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11884]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If Hb &lt;10 Asymptomatic</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- Symptomatic.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11885]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Or mild symptoms.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>- Intolerant women.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11886]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11887]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hb &lt;10 in antenatal period =&gt; delivery in obs</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tetric</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> unit.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[11888]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Active management of 3</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>rd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Cali